      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Initially, dissolve FeCl2・4H2O in 25% HCl, then add distilled water followedby the other components."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Store in the dark at 4C."
    }
  ]
